WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.876
The destination is only half the story

00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:34.360
Same outcome. Different process.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:53.388
Separate outcome from process

00:00:53.388 --> 00:01:17.240
Make every requirement inspectable

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:40.012
Separate preparation from authority

00:01:40.012 --> 00:02:04.248
The gap becomes visible

00:02:04.248 --> 00:02:26.756
A different criterion changes the picture

00:02:26.756 --> 00:02:55.816
Evaluate the outcome. Examine the process.
